label malik_skyrim_parody:
    Malik "Hey you… you're finally awake."
    MCname "What time is it?"
    Malik "You were trying to cross the courtyard, right? Walked straight into that campus security ambush. Same as us… and that thief over there."
    MCname "Damn you Alphas. Campus was fine until you came along."
    Malik "Campus security was nice and lazy. If they hadn't been looking for you…"
    MCname "You there. You and me we shouldn't even be here."
    Malik "It's these damn Alphas the Empire wants."
    MCname "Hahaha god the memories"
    Malik "Right!!! but man my head is thumpin"
    MCname "Same bro..."
    Malik "Last night was wild bro"
    MCname "I could used to parties like that"
    Malik "Join us man and that becomes a weekend thing"
    MCname "Damn..it is tempting..."
    Malik "Think about it, girls, booze, and wild ass parties every weekend..."
    MCname "Alright Alright man i'll pledge man"
    Malik "Thats what the fuck im talking about!!!"
