    #show mc flex at left

    Malik "Come here, man."

    "You step forward. Malik throws out his hand — not a normal handshake, but the kind that’s basically a bicep competition."

    play sound "handshake_slap.wav"

    "Your palms collide. Both of you tighten your grip. Arms flex. Veins pop. The room gets ten degrees hotter."

