    MCname "Trying? I'm beating you."
    Malik "Please. Your arm's shaking."
    MCname "That's your ego trembling."

    "Neither of you let go. It's not a handshake anymore — it's a dominance ritual."

    Malik "Alright, alright… you're Alpha material. I'll give you that."

    "He finally releases your hand, laughing."

    Malik "Welcome to the grind, pledge. Don't embarrass me."

    MCname "Wouldn't dream of it."

    Malik "Good. Because the real work starts now."
    Malik "I'm gonna call Brad and let him know you're pleding!!"
    MCname "I need to see what all these missed calls and messages are.."
