    Brad "Pledge,your trials start today so dont get comfortable"
    Brad "Malik will be your big brother during your trials"
    Brad "That means you'll adress him as big brother understood"
    MCname "Gotcha"
    Brad "....."
    Malik "He doesnt know any better..."
    Brad "I'll let it slide this time but you address me as father understood"
    MCname "Yes father!!!"
    Brad "You'll recieve tasks to complete via your Twatter app abd sometimes from Malik"
    Brad "You'll have an hour to xomplete each task or you're out understood?"
