    "{i}(Jeebus a bit extreme.....){/i}"
    Brad "Rules are as follows maggot"
    Brad "First nobody can help you"
    Brad "Second you cannot tell anyone these xhallenges are from Alpha"
    Brad "And last but not least your big brother or an Alpha member must be present to conirm completion"
    Brad "Any questions maggot?"
    MCname "No father"
    Brad "Good now get out there and make the Alpha proud-dismissed maggot"
    Malik "Let's grab some coffee"
    MCname "Finally"
    #They go uptairs to get some coffee and they sit
    Malik "Soooooo, how you feeling about pleding?"
    MCname "It's....interesting?"
    Malik "Oh yeah dude you are gonna love it"
    "{i}(Why do i get the sneaking suspicion that i'm not...){/i}"
