    MCname "What?"
    Tiff "Waffles are yummy though..."
    MCname "I mean...she's not lying"
    Kaia "....I'm a pancake girl"
    Tiff "Heretic!!!"
    MCname "Traitor!!!"
    #From the front of the classroom
    ProfessorHart "Pancakes are suprior"
    Kaia "Haha thanks PRofessor Hart"
    MCname "you bribed the teacher"
