    # --- TIME-LAPSE TRANSITION ---
    scene classroom_day
    with fade

    "{i}The group settles in, papers spreading across the desk as ideas start to flow.{/i}"
    pause 0.5
    "{i}Minutes blur into an hour—quiet focus, bursts of laughter, and steady progress.{/i}"
    pause 0.5
    "{i}By the time the sun shifts across the windows, their project finally takes shape.{/i}"

    scene classroom_afternoon
    with dissolve
    ProfessorHart "Alright everyone, time's up."
    ProfessorHart "Go ahead and turn in your thesis statements before you pack up."
    Kaia "{i}(Thank god—we actually finished ours.){/i}"
    Tiff "Ours is solid. Top tier. Waffle approved."
    MCname "I'd love to take that as high praise."
    ProfessorHart "If your group isn't done, submit what you have. I want to see your direction, not perfection."
    ProfessorHart "[MCname] stay"
