    ProfessorHart "Mr.Schafer im assuming you didnt get much sleep last night?"
    MCname "Long night Prof Hart"
    ProfessorHart "The Alpha parties tend to do that"
    MCname "....."
    ProfessorHart "Dont look so surprised..i was president of Flaunt when i was here as a student"
    MCname "Wow i would have never guessed"
